5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The room is a failure. We need to stop pretending it works for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree. But before we decide, I need to see the actual costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just want to know who actually uses it. It feels random to me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We are neighbors, yet strangers. The space must reflect that broken bond.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the hidden labor. Who cleans up after the mess?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Daisuke, costs are secondary. The primary issue is the noise leaking out.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Noise is a symptom. The invoice for the partition wall is the root.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, do you mean the crumbs? I saw a lot of crumbs yesterday.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,The crumbs are small. The silence between us is the real debris.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes. And the bins. Who empties them? It is never me.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I will check the sound levels. It is a measurable problem, not a feeling.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the invoices. We need to know what we are paying.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will count the people. I want to see the tally of use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the facilities callouts. And the final clear-out of the fridge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
