35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The data is clear. Two people use it constantly. The rest are ghosts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the invoices. We paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings. It is not worth it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,I counted the crumbs. It is a disaster. The bins are full of lunch scraps.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found the spot. The last hard talk happened right here, in the open.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The fridge was cleared twice. The same person did it. That is unpaid labor.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if it is not worth it, we should stop paying for it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. But the wall is thin. We need to fix that first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, who is the person who always cleans? I want to help.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"The open space forced that conversation. It was painful, but it was honest.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, it is not about helping. It is about who is forced to do it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,The two heavy users are the problem. They need a different space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The partition wall is the key. If we fix it, the room works.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,I think we should make it a place for quiet work. No eating.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we make it quiet, we lose the chance to talk. We need a place to speak.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Quiet work means no one has to clean up after a meal. That is the point.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
