60,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C is the only logical choice. It solves the noise and the mess.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am hesitant. If we choose C, we lose the chance to talk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I like C. I can read my books there. No crumbs, no noise.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,I fear C. It makes us strangers. We need a place to say the hard things.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,C removes the burden of cleaning. It is the most efficient use of time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, you can talk in the hallway. The room is for rest, not drama.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,The hallway is not private. The wall is thin. We need a real solution.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, I agree. The hallway is too loud. The room is quiet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,The hallway is where we avoid each other. The room is where we meet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the wall is thin, but the hours are not. We save time with C.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,The data supports C. The heavy users will stop using it if it is quiet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am still worried about the cost. But C seems the least bad.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for C. It is fair. Everyone gets a quiet spot.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,I will vote for B. We need to talk. We need to be seen.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for C. It is the only option that does not create new work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
